  "id": "baklava-cake",
  "name": "Baklava Cake",
  "subtitle": "A layered cake with crisp filo, nuts, honey, and rosewater",
  "description": "A semolina cake is baked with buttered filo and finished with a cinnamon-honey syrup, chopped nuts, rose petals, and rosewater cream.",
